#: kcmaudiocd.cpp:274
msgid ""
"<h1>Audio CDs</h1> The Audio CD IO-Slave enables you to easily create wav, "
"MP3 or Ogg Vorbis files from your audio CD-ROMs or DVDs. The slave is "
"invoked by typing <i>\"audiocd:/\"</i> in Konqueror's location bar. In this "
"module, you can configure encoding, and device settings. Note that MP3 and "
"Ogg Vorbis encoding are only available if KDE was built with a recent "
"version of the LAME or Ogg Vorbis libraries."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Audio CD</h1> The Audio CD IO-Slave 讓您能輕易地從您的音樂 CD-ROM 或 DVD "
"建立 wav 、 MP3 或 Ogg Vorbis 檔案。您可以在 Konqueror 的位址列鍵入 <i>"
"「audiocd:/」</i> 來呼叫它。在此模組中，您可以設定編碼和裝置設置。注意只有當 "
"KDE 建構時包含新版本的 LAME 或 Ogg Vorbis 函式庫，才能使用 MP3 與 Ogg Vorbis "
"編碼。"

